      "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\nAdd Cambricon MLU coverage for SGLang rotary embeddings and connect the\r\nexisting `RotaryEmbedding` implementation to the FlagTree Cambricon Triton\r\nRoPE kernel.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n- Add MLU backend detection.\r\n- Route `RotaryEmbedding` to the Cambricon Triton RoPE implementation.\r\n- Avoid the CUDA/vLLM fallback path on MLU.\r\n- Preserve packed token layout handling.\r\n- Make cosine and sine cache tensors contiguous for the MLU kernel.\r\n- Add an MLU regression test comparing the Triton path with the native path.\r\n\r\n## Accuracy Tests\r\n\r\nExecuted on a Cambricon MLU370 device:\r\n\r\n```text\r\ntest/manual/rotary/test_rope_mlu.py\r\n1 passed\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37880772881](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37880772881)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37880772675](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37880772675)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37880772938](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37880772938)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
